<title>NETHERLANDS: TENNIS-HEINEKEN TROPHY MEN/WOMEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HEINEKEN TROPHY MEN/WOMEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DEN BOSCH 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results of the</p>
<p>Heineken Trophy combined $500,000 ATP men's and $175,000 WTA</p>
<p>women's tennis tournament on Monday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seed):</p>
<p>Men's:</p>
<p>Chris Woodruff (U.S.) beat Dennis van Scheppingen (Netherlands)</p>
<p>6-4 6-0</p>
<p>6-Magnus Gustafsson (Sweden) beat Dominik Hrbaty (Slovakia) 3-6</p>
<p>6-3 7-5</p>
<p>Sjeng Schalken (Netherlands) beat 7-Thomas Johansson (Sweden)</p>
<p>6-0 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Women's:</p>
<p>3-Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) beat Tamarine Tanasugarn</p>
<p>(Thailand) 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>Francesca Lubiani (Italy) beat Petra Langrova (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>6-2 6-4</p>
<p>4-Karina Habsudova (Slovakia) beat Jana Kandarr (Germany) 6-3</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>1-Anke Huber (Germany) bye</p>
<p>2-Marie Pierce (France) bye</p>
<p>Add men:</p>
<p>8-Francisco Clavet (Spain) beat Jacco Eltingh (Netherlands) 7-6</p>
<p>(8-6) 6-3</p>
<p>Hendrik Dreekmann (Germany) beat Slava Dosedel (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>5-7 7-6 (8-6) 7-5</p>
<p>Add women:</p>
<p>Patricia Hy-Boulais (Canada) beat Yuka Yoshida (Japan) 6-1 4-6</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Sarah Pitowski (France) beat Els Callens (Belgium) 6-1 3-6 6-0</p>
<p>Magdalena Maleeva (Bulgaria) beat Stephanie Deville (Belgium)</p>
<p>6-2 6-1</p>
</text>
